cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Zeit in your work, please cite it as below, and cite the papers of the methods you used."
type: software
title: "Zeit: change detection and time series analysis of Earth observation data cubes"
abstract: >-
  Zeit (zeit-cdts) is a Python package for Earth observation data cube processing and time series analysis: change
  detection and trajectory methods such as LandTrendr, CCDC, BFAST and TWDTW, phenology, accuracy assessment,
  embeddings and deep learning, over cloud-native data (STAC, Xarray, Dask).
authors:
  - family-names: Lacerda
    given-names: Eduardo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3803-5842"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24515400
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24515400
    description: "The concept DOI of Zeit on Zenodo: it resolves to the latest version, and each version has its own DOI."
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/sacridini/zeit-cdts"
url: "https://sacridini.github.io/zeit-cdts/"
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - Earth observation
  - data cubes
  - time series
  - change detection
  - LandTrendr
  - CCDC
  - BFAST
  - TWDTW
  - phenology
